{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"content":"The air here is cold and sharp, carrying the scent of salt and brine that seems to settle into one’s clothes and hair no matter how often I rinse it out. I suspect I look rather wild, my hair tangled with straw and my face etched with lines that were not there a week ago, but the silence of the house provides a strange comfort. It is not an empty silence, of course; it is the constant, rhythmic roar of the ocean against the cliffs, a sound so pervasive that I find myself checking for it when waking, as if expecting to hear a clock ticking in the background.\n\nI have spent the last two days walking the boardwalk, watching the fog roll in and out like a slow exhalation from the earth. The town is quiet, many of the shops closed for the season, saving their lights for the summer crowds. There is a freedom in this emptiness, a sense that the world has paused to let the weather have its say. I am thinking more than I speak, and the thoughts are heavier here, stripped of the distractions of the city.\n\nI hope your cough has settled. I brought you a small bottle of honey from the shop in the village; I left it on the table by the door,","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461360,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01a1c6542e7590078","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,